title: medtokenizers
abstract: >-
  Continuous and discrete tokenization modules for 2D and 3D medical
  imaging, including VAE/AE, VQ/FSQ/LFQ/ResidualFSQ, and TiTok tokenizers with
  training and evaluation infrastructure.
